{
  "$schema": "../schemas/dream-card.schema.json",
  "schemaVersion": "0.1.0",
  "meta": {
    "id": "dream.kailu-jiangjun.du-shan-ji",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "title": "渡山记",
    "synopsis": "石槛村通往山外的路因山崩断绝三年，少年阿渡为了给病重祖父求药，独自带着旧斧进入被众人视为死路的山道。他在雾中遇见戴面神秘人，被提醒路不是等出来的，而是要有人先走进去。阿渡在力竭与怀疑中继续开路，最终劈开巨石、找回山道，并从山外带回药材。归来时，神秘人显露自己是开路将军，告诉阿渡他并不是被替代拯救的人，而是新的开路者。",
    "match": {
      "tags": ["开路将军", "无路之地", "祖父", "求药", "山村", "傩面", "自我突破"],
      "situations": ["被环境困住", "需要第一个行动", "他人不相信", "为了亲人承担风险", "寻找出路"],
      "emotions": ["迷茫", "孤独", "犹疑", "坚持", "被召唤"],
      "dilemmas": ["明知可能失败仍要开始", "众人放弃时是否独行", "无法证明结果时是否继续"],
      "relationships": ["祖孙", "村庄与个体", "神灵与少年", "前人和后来者"],
      "excludeTags": []
    },
    "officeCandidates": [
      {
        "officeId": "office.kailu-jiangjun",
        "fit": 1,
        "reason": "故事核心是从无路之地先行开路，并在结尾完成与开路将军的照面。"
      }
    ],
    "tone": ["山雾", "古村", "低回", "坚忍", "启示"],
    "estimatedDurationSeconds": 360,
    "culturalSources": [
      {
        "id": "source.dejiang-nuotangxi-kailu-jiangjun",
        "title": "德江傩堂戏《开洞》开路将军面具",
        "region": "贵州德江",
        "reference": "reference-materials/中国傩戏网_面具图片/013_开路将军 德江傩堂戏《开洞》_01.png",
        "note": "当前故事借用“开路将军”的职能意象；具体视觉素材后续可替换为正式 assetId。"
      }
    ],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  "data": {
    "acts": [
      {
        "id": "act-01",
        "title": "断路之村",
        "backgroundAssetId": "background.stone-sill-village",
        "characters": [
          {"instanceId": "elder", "assetId": "character.village-elder", "position": "left"},
          {"instanceId": "adu", "assetId": "character.adu", "position": "right"}
        ],
        "texts": [
          {"id": "act-01-text-01", "content": "千年前，有一座山村，叫作石槛村。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-02", "content": "村口有一条路，原本通往山外的集镇。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-03", "content": "三年前，山崩断路，碎石封死了出口。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-04", "content": "从那以后，村里再没有人走出去，也没有外人走进来。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-05", "content": "村里的人渐渐相信：这条路，本就是断的。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-06", "content": "阿渡，你又在村口站着。路断了，看也是断的。", "speakerId": "elder", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "村中老者"}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-07", "content": "我知道。", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-08", "content": "那就回去吧。你祖父病了三年，该陪着他。", "speakerId": "elder", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "村中老者"}}
        ],
        "choices": [],
        "notes": "场景：深山之中，一座小村依崖而建。村口立着一块被苔藓覆盖的石碑，上刻「此路不通」四字。天色阴沉，云压山腰，远处山崩的碎石仍堆在村口道路上，荆棘已从石缝间疯长出来。\n原始在场：村中老者 · 我（少年，约十五六岁） · 围观村民数人\n迁移备注：原 HTML 在场还包括围观村民数人；当前 characters 仅放可摆位前景角色。"
      },
      {
        "id": "act-02",
        "title": "祖父之愿",
        "backgroundAssetId": "background.grandfather-hut",
        "characters": [
          {"instanceId": "adu", "assetId": "character.adu", "position": "left"},
          {"instanceId": "grandfather", "assetId": "character.grandfather", "position": "right"}
        ],
        "texts": [
          {"id": "act-02-text-01", "content": "少年的祖父，是村里最后一个还记得路曾经通的人。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-02", "content": "他年轻时走过那条路，到山外买过盐、请过大夫。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-03", "content": "如今他病重，山外的药材送不进来。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-04", "content": "村里的人都认了命。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-05", "content": "阿渡……", "speakerId": "grandfather", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "祖父"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-06", "content": "祖父，我在。", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-07", "content": "我想起……那条路。", "speakerId": "grandfather", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "祖父"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-08", "content": "哪条路？", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-09", "content": "通往山外的那条。我年轻时走过。", "speakerId": "grandfather", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "祖父"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-10", "content": "如今他们说，那是死路。", "speakerId": "grandfather", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "祖父"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-11", "content": "可我记得，它原本是通的。", "speakerId": "grandfather", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "祖父"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-12", "content": "（沉默良久）我知道。", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}}
        ],
        "choices": [],
        "notes": "场景：屋内。土灶燃着柴火，光线昏黄。草席上躺着一位白发老人，呼吸微弱。墙上挂着一柄生锈的斧头，斧刃上有旧日的磨痕。\n原始在场：我 · 祖父（病重，卧于草席）\n迁移备注：墙上生锈斧头属于场景道具，暂不单独建 assetId。"
      },
      {
        "id": "act-03",
        "title": "无人肯行",
        "backgroundAssetId": "background.ancestral-hall-rain",
        "characters": [
          {"instanceId": "elder", "assetId": "character.village-elder", "position": "left"},
          {"instanceId": "adu", "assetId": "character.adu", "position": "center"},
          {"instanceId": "villager-a", "assetId": "character.villager-a", "position": "right"}
        ],
        "texts": [
          {"id": "act-03-text-01", "content": "少年把祖父的话告诉了村里人。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-02", "content": "他说，他要带着斧头，去把那条断路砍开。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-03", "content": "没有人肯跟他去。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-04", "content": "那路断了三年，谁也开不了。", "speakerId": "villager-a", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "村民甲"}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-05", "content": "山神不让通，你砍了又长。", "speakerId": "villager-b", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "村民乙"}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-06", "content": "阿渡，你一个少年，能做什么？", "speakerId": "elder", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "村中老者"}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-07", "content": "我不知道能不能做成。", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-08", "content": "但祖父记得，它原本是通的。", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-09", "content": "你祖父糊涂了，你也跟着糊涂？", "speakerId": "villager-a", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "村民甲"}}
        ],
        "choices": [],
        "notes": "场景：村中祠堂前，众人围坐。天将雨，风从山口灌入，吹动祠堂檐角的旧幡。\n原始在场：我 · 村中老者 · 数位村民\n迁移备注：村民乙作为文本说话人保留，画面中以 villager-representative 代表数位村民。"
      },
      {
        "id": "act-04",
        "title": "雾中遇人",
        "backgroundAssetId": "background.foggy-broken-road",
        "characters": [
          {"instanceId": "adu", "assetId": "character.adu", "position": "left"},
          {"instanceId": "masked", "assetId": "character.masked-kailu-jiangjun", "position": "right"}
        ],
        "texts": [
          {"id": "act-04-text-01", "content": "少年砍了半日，雾越来越浓。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-02", "content": "他忽然发现，雾里站着一个人。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-03", "content": "那人戴着一面木面，看不清脸。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-04", "content": "（惊）你是谁？", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-05", "content": "一个路过的人。", "speakerId": "masked", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-06", "content": "你来这里，想要什么？", "speakerId": "masked", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-07", "content": "祖父病重，山外的药送不进来。我想，把路砍开。", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-08", "content": "你一个人？", "speakerId": "masked", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-09", "content": "没有人肯跟我来。", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-10", "content": "他们说，这条路断了。", "speakerId": "masked", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-11", "content": "可它原本是通的。", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-12", "content": "是。它原本是通的。", "speakerId": "masked", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-13", "content": "路，不是等出来的。", "speakerId": "masked", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-14", "content": "我曾在更早之前，见过一个少年，也站在无路之地。", "speakerId": "masked", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-15", "content": "后来呢？", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-16", "content": "后来，他没有等。", "speakerId": "masked", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-17", "content": "神秘人隐入雾中，只余斧声在山间回响。", "speakerId": "stage", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "action"}}
        ],
        "choices": [],
        "notes": "场景：山道废墟。巨大的碎石横亘在原路上，荆棘从石缝间疯长，雾气从谷底涌上来，浓得化不开。少年手持生锈的斧头，独自站在石前。身后是村，前方是无路。\n原始在场：我 · 戴面神秘人（雾中显现，身份未明）\n迁移备注：戴面神秘人身份未明，assetId 先使用开路将军占位角色。"
      },
      {
        "id": "act-05",
        "title": "开路",
        "backgroundAssetId": "background.deep-broken-road",
        "characters": [
          {"instanceId": "adu", "assetId": "character.adu", "position": "left"},
          {"instanceId": "masked", "assetId": "character.masked-kailu-jiangjun", "position": "right"}
        ],
        "texts": [
          {"id": "act-05-text-01", "content": "少年砍了一日一夜。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-02", "content": "石头太硬，斧头卷了刃。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-03", "content": "荆棘砍断一根，又长出两根。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-04", "content": "雾从四面涌来，像是要告诉少年：此路不通，回去吧。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-05", "content": "（喘息）他们说得对，这条路，是断的。", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-06", "content": "（停斧）", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-07", "content": "（雾中出现）你为何停下？", "speakerId": "masked", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-08", "content": "我砍不动了。石头太硬，荆棘砍了又长。", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-09", "content": "你来此，是为了证明这条路通吗？", "speakerId": "masked", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-10", "content": "我不知道……", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-11", "content": "通不通，从来不是你一人说算的。", "speakerId": "masked", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-12", "content": "但你可以选择——做第一个走进去的人。", "speakerId": "masked", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-13", "content": "（沉默良久）……做第一个走进去的人。", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-14", "content": "（举起卷刃的斧）通不通，总要有人先走进去看。", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-15", "content": "一斧劈下，巨石裂出一道缝。光从缝中透入。", "speakerId": "stage", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "action"}}
        ],
        "choices": [],
        "notes": "场景：断路深处。碎石堆叠成墙，荆棘缠结如网。少年双手磨破，斧头卷刃。雾越来越浓，仿佛山要把他推回去。天色已无法分辨昼夜。\n原始在场：我 · 戴面神秘人\n迁移备注：斧头卷刃与巨石裂缝属于动作/场景变化，暂写入文本与备注，不扩展道具 schema。"
      },
      {
        "id": "act-06",
        "title": "路通",
        "backgroundAssetId": "background.opened-mountain-path",
        "characters": [
          {"instanceId": "adu", "assetId": "character.adu", "position": "center"}
        ],
        "texts": [
          {"id": "act-06-text-01", "content": "那一斧下去，石头裂了。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-06-text-02", "content": "不是因为少年力气大。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-06-text-03", "content": "而是因为这条路上，终于有一个人，先走了进来。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-06-text-04", "content": "路重新出现了。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-06-text-05", "content": "（看着前方的路）原来……它真的还在。", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-06-text-06", "content": "（回头）你——", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-06-text-07", "content": "少年回过头，那个戴面的人已经不在了。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-06-text-08", "content": "只余雾散开，和一条重新出现的路。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-06-text-09", "content": "（向前迈步）祖父，我记得它原本是通的。", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-06-text-10", "content": "少年走下山外。雾散，山道蜿蜒。", "speakerId": "stage", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "action"}}
        ],
        "choices": [],
        "notes": "场景：碎石崩落，荆棘退散。一条被掩埋三年的山道，在少年脚下重新显现。山外有风灌入，带着陌生草木的气味。远处山坳处露出集镇的一线灯火。\n原始在场：我\n迁移备注：戴面神秘人在文本中已离场，画面角色只保留少年。"
      },
      {
        "id": "act-07",
        "title": "归路与得面",
        "backgroundAssetId": "background.village-return-road",
        "characters": [
          {"instanceId": "elder", "assetId": "character.village-elder", "position": "left"},
          {"instanceId": "adu", "assetId": "character.adu", "position": "center"},
          {"instanceId": "masked", "assetId": "character.masked-kailu-jiangjun", "position": "right"}
        ],
        "texts": [
          {"id": "act-07-text-01", "content": "三日后，少年从山外回来。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-02", "content": "他带回了药材，也带回了一条路。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-03", "content": "村里人站在村口，看着他，没有人说话。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-04", "content": "……路，通了？", "speakerId": "elder", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "村中老者"}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-05", "content": "通了。", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-06", "content": "（倚门而望）我记得，它原本是通的。", "speakerId": "grandfather", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "祖父"}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-07", "content": "村口的石碑旁，立着那个戴面的人。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-08", "content": "少年走过去，这一次，他没有害怕。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-09", "content": "你……一直都在？", "speakerId": "adu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-10", "content": "（缓缓摘下面）我并非路过。", "speakerId": "masked", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-11", "content": "千年前，我也曾是一个少年，站在无路之地。", "speakerId": "masked", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-12", "content": "他们唤我——开路将军。", "speakerId": "masked", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-13", "content": "我今日来此，不是替你开路。", "speakerId": "masked", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-14", "content": "是要让你知道——在你之前，也曾有人先走进过那片无路之地。", "speakerId": "masked", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-15", "content": "如今，你是那个先走进去的人了。", "speakerId": "masked", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-16", "content": "神秘人转身，走入山雾，不复再见。", "speakerId": "stage", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "action"}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-17", "content": "你求的是一条路。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "final-narration"}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-18", "content": "可这条路，已经有人在告诉你，它断了。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "final-narration"}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-19", "content": "千年前，曾有一位将军先走入无路之地；", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "final-narration"}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-20", "content": "千年前的那一日，他曾遇见一个少年。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "final-narration"}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-21", "content": "如今，那个少年是你。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "final-narration"}},
          {"id": "act-07-text-22", "content": "你愿意，做下一个走进去的人吗？", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "final-narration"}}
        ],
        "choices": [],
        "notes": "场景：数日后，村口。石碑「此路不通」被苔藓覆盖得更深。少年背着药囊从山道走来，身后是重新被踩出来的路。村民立在村口，无人言语。祖父被抬出，倚在门边。村口石碑旁，立着那个戴面的人。\n原始在场：我 · 村中老者 · 祖父（倚门而望） · 众村民 · 戴面神秘人\n迁移备注：原 HTML 在场包括祖父与众村民；受 schema characters maxItems=3 限制，祖父与众村民作为场景/文本对象保留，不单独摆位。"
      }
    ]
  }
}
